{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden object game where you must find all the shells to complete the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f 1 Large Hand-Drawn Watercolour Artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc0c 100 Hidden Shells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 1 Achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 No Hints or Support for extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Zoom In/Out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing music and background sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f Use only your Mouse or Mouse + Keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Autosave. Pick up from where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f Reset progress and play again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I lost my collection of 100 shells in the backyard. Can you help me find them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Left Mouse Button + Mouse Movement: Pan and Movement in the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Left Mouse Button\u00a0 to\u00a0 Collect Shells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Wheel for Zooming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD / Keyboard Arrows: Movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press ESC in-game to access the Pause Menu.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Immersed:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and dreamy metallophone music accompanied by the nonstop chirping of birds. Let loose of your inner child and go on a small adventure in the backyard.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Great Collector!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3900300/ddbb8c1ec04a5bf7fff1ae6510f3270450d3926d.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/390